Naming rules: enemy energy projectiles are ion bolts (ION is an enemy-only damage type — the player has no ranged weapon). All timers are given in seconds with frame counts at 30 fps in parentheses. Combat windows are additionally given in sprite frames. All pixel values assume 32 px tiles. The base resolution is 640 x 360; a "screen width" is 20 tiles.

