Difficulty tension, acknowledged: the Reaper is an optional high-difficulty boss reached predominantly by the players who are struggling most. Mitigations: the Echo Reaper simplification, the retreat door, dialogue that teaches the rules (§9.8), and the assist toggle "Reaper Mercy" (Echo HP -30%, no Bone Wave). The 2-attempt block is intended as a real stake, not punishment for its own sake — if playtesting shows spiral frustration, the fallback is dropping permanent mode to dialogue-only escalation.
